NOTE:PROFESSIONAL PROFILE\n\nCurrent Role:\nGroup IT at Bidcorp Food Africa (BCFA). Parent company representative attending Chipkins Puratos presentation.\n\nScope of Responsibility:\n- IT strategy and governance across Bidcorp Food Africa group\n- Technology infrastructure\n- Digital transformation initiatives\n- IT operations and support\n- Cybersecurity\n- Systems integration across group entities (including Chipkins Puratos)\n\nOrganisational Context:\nBidcorp Food Africa is a subsidiary of JSE-listed Bid Corporation Limited and holds 50% of Chipkins Puratos. Martin's Group IT role means he oversees technology across multiple BCFA entities\, not just Chipkins Puratos.\n\nCRITICAL STAKEHOLDER:\nAs Group IT\, Martin is essential for any GenAI deployment:\n- Will assess technical feasibility and infrastructure requirements\n- Will evaluate integration with existing systems\n- Will consider security\, compliance\, and data governance implications\n- Has influence on technology adoption across broader BCFA group\n- Can champion or block technology initiatives\n\nRelated Attendees (Support/Technical Functions):\n- Tahlia Elcome (Solutions Architect - Chipkins Puratos)\n- David Magrobi (Technical Manager Plants - Chipkins Puratos)\n- Carl Van Der Velden (Business Controller - Chipkins Puratos)\n\nSources:\n- https://www.bcfa.co.za\n- https://www.bidcorpgroup.com/emerging-markets.php\n- https://za.linkedin.com/company/bidcorp-food-africa
